__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.stamp

# hand-off bundles built from shares; the repo publishes files, not archives
*.zip

# superseded draft material kept on disk for traceability, not for publishing
# (may contain local/machine-specific paths — see the archive's own README)
skill-toolkit/skills/scientific-research-guide/archive/
/archive/
*.lock

# .claude/ is personal-by-default (tools/COLLECTION-RULES.md "Never collect"),
# with three tracked exceptions that make this repo the SOURCE of the cloud
# environment: the project-scope settings and the two shell hooks they mount.
# Each is declared in tools/share-manifest.toml [structure] with its reason;
# anything else under .claude/ (settings.local.json, caches) stays ignored.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/hooks/
.claude/hooks/*
!.claude/hooks/session-start.sh
!.claude/hooks/run-hook.sh
